Sources: Eurostat, EU-SILC: ilc_di12 (Gini coefficient of equivalised disposable income), ilc_di11 (S80/S20 income quintile share ratio) and ilc_di01 (distribution of income by deciles). Theil approximations computed by THEILUMINA from the decile shares s_k: T_1 \approx \sum_k s_k \ln(10\,s_k) and T_0 \approx \sum_k 0.1 \ln(0.1/s_k).

World: Gini and Theil T_0 (World Bank PIP)


